{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-iso3166-svk"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Independent Public-Sector Market-Entry & Procurement Compliance Service — Slovakia"
 :itonami.blueprint/iso3166 "SVK"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :public-sector/market-entry-compliance
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:eu-single-market-access :public-spend-transparency :cross-border-friction-reduction]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :market-entry-compliance-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics false
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:identity :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "src/marketentry/* (langgraph-clj StateGraph actor, compiled via
 `operation/build` -> `g/state-graph` -> `g/compile-graph` with
 `interrupt-before #{:request-approval}`): facts.cljc (official
 spec-basis catalog, curl/WebFetch-verified against uvo.gov.sk,
 isepvo.sk, orsr.sk, economy.gov.sk, financnasprava.sk, slov-lex.sk --
 Obchodný register incorporation, Zoznam hospodárskych subjektov / EPVO
 (IS EVO + Elektronické trhovisko) registration, IČ DPH/DIČ, plus two
 flagship field groups: `:fdi-screening-*` (Zákon č. 497/2022 Z. z.,
 Ministerstvo hospodárstva SR) and `:platform-oversight-authority`/
 `:platform-operator-authority`/`:platform-operator-note`/
 `:platform-operator-provenance` keeping ÚVO's legal/regulatory-
 oversight role and Úrad vlády Slovenskej republiky's separate IS
 EVO/EPVO-operator role, since 31 March 2022, as two DISTINCT catalog
 fields -- mirroring `cloud-itonami-iso3166-lva`'s IUB/VDAA split --
 plus `:corporate-number-*` (IČO, Štatistický úrad SR) and `:dic-*`
 (Finančná správa), kept as two DISTINCT authorities), governor.cljc
 (Market-Entry Compliance Governor -- spec-basis HARD check,
 evidence-incomplete HARD check, `:fdi-screening-missing` HARD check
 (flagship #1, Zákon č. 497/2022 Z. z.), `:platform-operator-fused`
 HARD check independently verifying a `:jurisdiction/assess` proposal
 never collapses ÚVO and Úrad vlády SR into one fused authority
 (flagship #2), engagement-fee-mismatch independent recompute,
 `:ico-unverified` HARD check (Štatistický úrad SR, NOT Finančná
 správa), `:dic-unverified` HARD check (Finančná správa),
 confidence-floor/actuation gate, plus double-draft/double-submit
 guards), store.cljc (MemStore + DatomicStore via
 `io.github.kotoba-lang/langchain-store`
 (`ls/enc`/`ls/dec*`/`ls/read-stream`/`ls/append-blob!`) instead of a
 hand-rolled EDN-blob codec), registry.cljc (pure-function
 filing-draft/filing-submit record construction + fee recompute),
 marketentryllm.cljc (mock MarketEntry Advisor, with injectable
 `:no-spec?` and `:fuse-platform-operator?` failure modes),
 operation.cljc (intake -> advise -> govern -> decide ->
 [request-approval ->] commit/hold StateGraph, `store/append-ledger!`
 called from both the `:commit` and `:hold` nodes), phase.cljc (0->3
 rollout, `:filing/draft`/`:filing/submit` permanently excluded from
 every phase's `:auto` set). Tests cover the governor contract
 (including the ÚVO/Úrad vlády SR distinction, both the clean path and
 the fused-claim HARD hold; IČO/DIČ missing HARD holds; interrupt-
 before pause; ledger append-only-ness), facts, phase, registry, store
 parity (MemStore vs DatomicStore) across backends. Alongside
 marketentry, this repo also carries a separate `statute` general-law
 catalog (ADR-2607141700) and a `culture` regional-culture catalog,
 both left untouched by this pass."}
